WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Mark a stem and three pairs of leaves.
Stitch the stem with an Aari hook.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
With a hand needle, come up at the leaf base.
Go down beside it and leave a loop.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Come up inside the loop at the marked tip.
Draw the loop gently against the needle.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Take a tiny stitch across the loop tip
to hold the leaf in place.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Repeat for all six leaves. Keep each loop open
and match the tips in each pair.
